/ActualText (Speaking of the PAStimes, your astute editor Richard Meyers reminds all of us to send him editor@pasaz.org your images, stories and now advertisements for items you wish to sell. Of course all should be related to our fun hobby, astronomy. The PAStimes is not only emailed to you directly, but also published on our public website.)
