/ActualText (Ammonia-Water Clouds: The shallow lightning occurs in clouds made of ammonia and water, where ammonia lowers the freezing point of water, enabling lightning to form at higher altitudes. This finding revealed a previously unknown layer of atmospheric chemistry in Jupiter's weather systems.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [9]
